{"task_id": "Mbpp/952", "original_task_id": 952, "entry_point": "nCr_mod_p", "prompt": "Write a function to compute the value of ncr mod p.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef nCr_mod_p(n, r, p):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to compute the value of ncr mod p.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def nCr_mod_p(n, r, p): \r\n\tif (r > n- r): \r\n\t\tr = n - r \r\n\tC = [0 for i in range(r + 1)] \r\n\tC[0] = 1 \r\n\tfor i in range(1, n + 1): \r\n\t\tfor j in range(min(i, r), 0, -1): \r\n\t\t\tC[j] = (C[j] + C[j-1]) % p \r\n\treturn C[r] ", "tests": "assert nCr_mod_p(10, 2, 13) == 6\nassert nCr_mod_p(11, 3, 14) == 11\nassert nCr_mod_p(18, 14, 19) == 1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "calibration", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
