{"task_id": "Mbpp/772", "original_task_id": 772, "entry_point": "remove_length", "prompt": "Write a function to remove all the words with k length in the given string.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef remove_length(test_str, K):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to remove all the words with k length in the given string.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def remove_length(test_str, K):\r\n  temp = test_str.split()\r\n  res = [ele for ele in temp if len(ele) != K]\r\n  res = ' '.join(res)\r\n  return (res) ", "tests": "assert remove_length('The person is most value tet', 3) == 'person is most value'\nassert remove_length('If you told me about this ok', 4) == 'If you me about ok'\nassert remove_length('Forces of darkeness is come into the play', 4) == 'Forces of darkeness is the'", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "calibration", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
